.TH TIMEZONES 1
.SH NAME
timezones - A custom command for displaying time zones, with optional visual mode.

.SH SYNOPSIS
timezones [OPTIONS]

.SH DESCRIPTION
The \fBtimezones\fR command prints the current date and time for various cities based on their respective time zones. A visual mode is also available, which displays live time.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB-vi\fR
Open in visual (live) mode.
.TP
\fB-in\fR
Show India time (Asia/Kolkata).
.TP
\fB-uk\fR
Show United Kingdom time (Europe/London).
.TP
\fB-hk\fR
Show Hong Kong time (Asia/Hong_Kong).
.TP
\fB-d\fR
Show Dubai time (Asia/Dubai).
.TP
\fB-jp\fR
Show Japan time (Asia/Tokyo).
.TP
\fB-mel\fR
Show Melbourne time (Australia/Melbourne).

.SH AUTHOR
Written by Mohammed Shoaib.

.SH SEE ALSO
date, timedatectl
